anchor (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First release. A focus and blocking tool for the GNOME desktop:
    sessions with three levels and a one-way ratchet, DNS and application
    blocking enforced by root daemons, breaks, weekly schedules, statistics
    kept locally, and a GTK4 interface in English and Spanish.

 -- Pablo Fernández Ríos <fernandezriospablo06@gmail.com>  Mon, 22 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000
